# Skills that must NEVER be published to this repo.
# CI fails if any skill name here matches a directory under skills/. This is a
# hard block: it holds even if a sync agent is told to add them, misreads intent,
# or sweeps a directory automatically.
#
# One entry per line. Shell globs (* ? [...]) are supported, so a prefix covers
# future additions without naming them. Comments and blank lines ignored.

cursive-agent-*
